---
// POS.Hfeit 5-Feature Bento Grid (High-Impact Copywriting & Restrained Accents)
---

<div id="features" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase">Operations Engineered for Rush Hour</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-5xl mt-2">
      Satu detik di meja kasir menentukan kepuasan pelanggan.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      Jangan biarkan sistem kasir yang lambat membuat pelanggan batal antre, pesanan tertukar di dapur, atau toko berhenti beroperasi saat koneksi internet terputus.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid (Row 1: Two Wide Hero Cards) -->
  <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: KDS Multi-Station Routing -->
    <div id="kds" class="lg:col-span-7 rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800 uppercase">Dapur &amp; Barista</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-3">Tiket otomatis terpisah ke stasiun yang tepat.</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Pesanan kopi langsung muncul di tablet Barista; pesanan makanan masuk ke layar Dapur. Hilangkan teriakan antrean dan risiko salah racik saat kafe penuh.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 p-5 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-800">
        <div class="flex justify-between text-zinc-300 font-bold mb-2">
          <span>STASIUN BARISTA &bull; TIKET #12</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">● SIAP DISAJIKAN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-zinc-400 text-[11px]">2x Aren Latte &bull; Less Sugar &bull; Meja OUT-04</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Peta Meja Dinamis & Move Table -->
    <div id="meja" class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800 uppercase">Manajemen Ruangan</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-3">Pindah meja dan gabung tagihan dalam 1 ketuk.</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Tamu pindah saat hujan tiba-tiba? Pindahkan seluruh pesanan dan tagihan dari Outdoor ke Meja Indoor tanpa membuat pesanan baru dari nol.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 p-5 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-800">
        <div class="flex justify-between font-bold mb-1 text-zinc-300">
          <span>OUT-04 ➔ IND-02</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ RELOKASI SELESAI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500">Seluruh tagihan &amp; item otomatis berpindah</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid (Row 2: Three Cards) -->
  <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 3: 100% Offline-First Resilient -->
    <div id="offline" class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800 uppercase">Reliabilitas</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-3">Internet mati total, kasir tetap jualan.</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Tidak ada istilah kasir macet karena sinyal provider putus. Transaksi tetap tersimpan aman di perangkat dan struk langsung tercetak.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 p-4 border border-zinc-200 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="font-bold text-zinc-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block"></span>
          OFFLINE MODE: AKTIF
        </div>
        <div class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] mt-1">Sinkronisasi otomatis saat internet pulih</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: QR Meja & Takeaway 3-Jalur -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800 uppercase">Self-Order</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-3">Tamu pesan mandiri, 0% potongan komisi.</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Urai antrean saat kasir ramai dengan QR pesan di meja. 100% uang penjualan langsung masuk ke rekening tanpa potongan aplikasi 20-30%.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 p-4 border border-zinc-200 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="font-bold text-zinc-900">0% KOMISI PIHAK KETIGA</div>
        <div class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] mt-1">100% pendapatan utuh milik toko Anda</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 5: Role PIN & Multi-Staff -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-zinc-800 uppercase">Keamanan Staf</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mt-3">Nol kebocoran kas dengan otorisasi PIN.</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
          Setiap pembatalan pesanan (void), diskon manual, dan pembukaan laci kasir wajib diverifikasi PIN Supervisor dengan jejak audit transparan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 p-4 border border-zinc-800 text-white font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="font-bold text-zinc-200">RBAC: OTORISASI SUPERVISOR</div>
        <div class="text-zinc-400 text-[10px] mt-0.5">Audit trail lengkap di tiap mutasi</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
